refactor CAN bus

- Connect DeltaQ to Varta CAN bus
- Disable charging by writing DeltaQ "CAN listen-only" SDO 0x2032.00=1_u8
- Enable charging by writing DeltaQ "CAN listen-only" SDO 0x2032.00=0_u8
- Modulate DeltaQ by writing DeltaQ "AC Current Limit" 0x2202.00 = (AC amp * 256.0) as u16

Needs XV-3300 "Varta" firmware.

Using zencan-cli:
```
can0>help write
Write an object via SDO

Usage: write <NODE_ID> <INDEX> <SUB> <DATA_TYPE> <VALUE>

Arguments:
  <NODE_ID>    The ID of the node to read from
  <INDEX>      The object index to read
  <SUB>        The sub object to read
  <DATA_TYPE>  How to interpret the value [possible values: u32, u16, u8, i32, i16, i8, f32, utf8]
  <VALUE>      The value to write

can0>write 100 0x2202 0x00 u16 0x0100
```

Value (0x0100) is AC amps * 256.
